  "title": "Cranberry Parfait",
  "description": "This cranberry parfait recipe makes a creamy, colorful trifle. It&#39;s a beautiful, easy dessert. It&#39;s quick to make and just needs three hours to chill.",
  "authors": [
    "Amy Lawler"
